    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-02-07",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Right to Eat Authentic and Legitimate Meat Act of 2025 or the REAL Meat Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits the use of federal funds to support, directly or indirectly, the production, advancement, or enhancement of cell-cultured meat. Under the bill,&nbsp;<em>cell-cultured meat</em> means meat that is sourced from the cells of animals and artificially produced in a laboratory.</p><p>The bill includes an exemption for federal funds of the National Aeronautics and Space Administration (NASA)&nbsp;that are used for activities related to cell-cultured meat that is intended for off-planet consumption.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-03-27T15:36:00Z"
      }
    ]
  },
